## Entry 001 — 2026-09-16 — Initial build (from scratch)

Built the complete one-page Starlink Authorized Retailer site.

**Revert:** delete the whole project directory and re-scaffold. This entry is
the initial commit-equivalent; there is no prior state to return to.

### Stack

| Piece | Version | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Next.js | 16.3.5 (App Router, Turbopack) | Static prerender of `/` for PageSpeed |
| React | 19.2.8 | Ships with Next 16 |
| TypeScript | 5.x | Required |
| Tailwind CSS | 4.x (`@theme` tokens) | No config file needed |
| `motion` | 13.x | Framer Motion's current package name |
| `lenis` | 1.3.x | Smooth scrolling |

Installed with:
```bash
npx create-next-app@latest . --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --no-src-dir --import-alias "@/*"
npm install motion lenis
```

### Files created

**Data layer**
- `lib/content.ts` — the single source of truth. Sections 1–11: retailer
  identity, nav, hero, marquee, service-line order, plan groups, hardware,
  setup steps, FAQ, footer, derived helpers.

**Primitives (`components/ui/`)**
- `PriceLockup.tsx` — the universal `<PriceLockup plan={plan} />`. Renders a
  flex row: `$` symbol, dominant integer (clamped to 2.5rem–3.5rem), muted
  cents, `/mo`. Visual row is `aria-hidden`; a single clean `sr-only`
  sentence is exposed instead. Falls back to "Custom pricing" when
  `plan.price` is undefined.
- `CallButton.tsx` — every phone CTA. Always `href={SITE.phoneHref}` and
  always carries `data-call-cta`.
- `Magnetic.tsx` — magnetic cursor pull for CTAs.
- `TiltCard.tsx` — 3D tilt + cursor-tracked specular glare for plan cards.
- `Reveal.tsx` — `Reveal`, `RevealText` (word-by-word mask), `StaggerGrid`,
  `StaggerItem`.
- `Marquee.tsx` — CSS-only infinite ticker; duplicate half is `aria-hidden`.
- `DeepSpace.tsx` — black-hole accretion disc + two parallax starfield layers.
  Pure CSS gradients; no canvas, no WebGL, no image payload.

**Providers**
- `components/providers/SmoothScroll.tsx` — Lenis setup + anchor interception
  with a −96px offset to clear the fixed chrome.

**Sections (`components/sections/`)**
- `Header.tsx` — exports `Logo`, `DisclosureBar`, `Header`.
- `Hero.tsx` — includes `OrbitalPaths` (SVG path-draw).
- `ZipChecker.tsx` — front-end only, validates 5-digit format.
- `PlanCard.tsx`, `Plans.tsx`, `FinePrint.tsx`, `HowItWorks.tsx`, `Faq.tsx`,
  `Footer.tsx`.

**App**
- `app/layout.tsx` — Inter (400/500/600 only), metadata, viewport, skip link.
- `app/page.tsx` — composes the 8 sections in canonical order.
- `app/globals.css` — brand tokens, layered base/components CSS, keyframes.
- `.claude/launch.json` — dev-server config for the preview pane.

### Section order (as built)

1. Top disclosure bar — persistent, non-dismissable
2. Sticky header — logo, anchor nav, phone-number CTA
3. Hero — eyebrow, H1, subline, price anchor, **ZIP checker + call button**,
   trust chips, marquee
4. Plans — data-driven service lines
5. Fine print — comparison table + `#hardware` kit grid
6. How it works — scroll-scrubbed dish assembly
7. FAQ — accordion
8. Footer

### Animations implemented

| Animation | Where |
|---|---|
| Lenis smooth scroll | `SmoothScroll.tsx` |
| Black hole / deep space | `DeepSpace.tsx` (Hero) |
| Parallax depth | `DeepSpace.tsx` — 3 layers at different rates |
| Scroll-scrubbed assembly | `HowItWorks.tsx` — `DishAssembly` |
| Scroll-triggered text reveal | `Reveal.tsx` — `RevealText` |
| SVG path draw | `Hero.tsx` `OrbitalPaths`, `HowItWorks.tsx` beam/cable |
| Magnetic buttons | `Magnetic.tsx` → `CallButton` |
| 3D card tilt | `TiltCard.tsx` → `PlanCard` |
| Staggered grid entrance | `StaggerGrid`/`StaggerItem` → plans, fine print, hardware, FAQ |
| Infinite marquee | `Marquee.tsx` |
| Clip-path wipe | `wipe-reveal` keyframe in `globals.css` |

All of it is reduced-motion aware: `useReducedMotion()` in JS, plus a global
`@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` block.

